            "start": 485,
            "end": 591,
            "quote": "2. [Ubuntu 安装 CUDA 全攻略：驱动配置、环境变量与多版本 ...](https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_31292729/article/details/165814988)",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-6",
            "event_id": "call_00_3CEgBGKnrLUKCs4Yi81A7246.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "af5dbaee1ebc95f9395b1a046e9c2a0713169d15804739ae3762161441e435fc",
            "start": 755,
            "end": 860,
            "quote": "3. [【保姆教程】Linux系统安装Cuda完整步骤_linux安装cuda ...](https://blog.csdn.net/m0_57409671/article/details/154279396)",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-7",
            "event_id": "call_00_3CEgBGKnrLUKCs4Yi81A7246.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "af5dbaee1ebc95f9395b1a046e9c2a0713169d15804739ae3762161441e435fc",
            "start": 1417,
            "end": 1533,
            "quote": "5. [Installing CUDA Toolkit on Ubuntu: A Comprehensive Guide](https://linuxvox.com/blog/install-cudatoolkit-ubuntu/)",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-8",
            "event_id": "call_00_3CEgBGKnrLUKCs4Yi81A7246.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "af5dbaee1ebc95f9395b1a046e9c2a0713169d15804739ae3762161441e435fc",
            "start": 612,
            "end": 671,
            "quote": "CUDA 是 NVIDIA 提供的并行计算平台，也是深度学习和 GPU 加速开发的技术基石。在 Ubuntu 系统 …",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-9",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "fd8db0577447d568173714efaf2c128ff74d6f74c68205fb26368031e13ce412",
            "start": 476,
            "end": 580,
            "quote": "网络 deb（推荐）：`sudo apt install cuda-toolkit-<ver>` 或旧的 `cuda` 元包，需先加 NVIDIA 仓库 keyring 与 `sources.list.d`；",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-10",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "fd8db0577447d568173714efaf2c128ff74d6f74c68205fb26368031e13ce412",
            "start": 851,
            "end": 913,
            "quote": "- `PATH` 增加 `/usr/local/cuda/bin`（为了 `nvcc`、`nvcc --version`）；",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-11",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "fd8db0577447d568173714efaf2c128ff74d6f74c68205fb26368031e13ce412",
            "start": 915,
            "end": 1003,
            "quote": "- `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` 增加 `/usr/local/cuda/lib64`（为了运行时找到 `libcudart.so`、`libcublas.so` 等）。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-12",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "fd8db0577447d568173714efaf2c128ff74d6f74c68205fb26368031e13ce412",
            "start": 1115,
            "end": 1198,
            "quote": "export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/cuda/lib64${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH}}",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-13",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "fd8db0577447d568173714efaf2c128ff74d6f74c68205fb26368031e13ce412",
            "start": 308,
            "end": 352,
            "quote": "先确认有支持的 NVIDIA 驱动：`nvidia-smi` 能列出 GPU 与驱动版本",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-14",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "fd8db0577447d568173714efaf2c128ff74d6f74c68205fb26368031e13ce412",
            "start": 1549,
            "end": 1620,
            "quote": "- `/usr/local/cuda/lib64` 与较新版本 `targets/x86_64-linux/lib` 路径哪个是官方当前写法。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-15",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "80e4eb0f3db9190a35368409052778953a3eea9a69a66c214161aced3256ef86",
            "start": 1378,
            "end": 1506,
            "quote": "网络 deb（推荐）：加 NVIDIA 仓库 keyring + `/etc/apt/sources.list.d/cuda-ubuntu<ver>-x86_64.list`，然后 `sudo apt install cuda-toolkit-<ver>`",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-16",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "80e4eb0f3db9190a35368409052778953a3eea9a69a66c214161aced3256ef86",
            "start": 1748,
            "end": 1796,
            "quote": "export PATH=/usr/local/cuda/bin${PATH:+:${PATH}}",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-17",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "80e4eb0f3db9190a35368409052778953a3eea9a69a66c214161aced3256ef86",
            "start": 1797,
            "end": 1880,
            "quote": "export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/cuda/lib64${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH}}",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-18",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "80e4eb0f3db9190a35368409052778953a3eea9a69a66c214161aced3256ef86",
            "start": 1707,
            "end": 1747,
            "quote": "# 追加到 ~/.bashrc 或 /etc/profile.d/cuda.sh",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-19",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "80e4eb0f3db9190a35368409052778953a3eea9a69a66c214161aced3256ef86",
            "start": 1930,
            "end": 1969,
            "quote": "nvcc --version          # 走 PATH 里的 bin",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-20",
